      "body": "## Motivation\n\nCombining `--enable-eplb` with `per_pass` or `per_token` is accepted at startup but crashes the scheduler on the first rebalance. EPLB requires object dumps, while these recorder modes only support file output.\n\nReject the combination early with an actionable error. Fixes #48403.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Validate the incompatible modes in `handle_eplb_and_dispatch`.\n- Add regression coverage for rejected (`per_pass`, `per_token`) and allowed (`None`, `stat`, `stat_approx`) modes.\n\n## Tests\n\nOn `297e54f` (v0.5.23):\n\n| Check | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| Test-only change (red) | 2 failed, 2 passed |\n| Patched `-k eplb` (green) | 2 passed, 5 subtests passed |\n| Full `test_server_args.py` | 322 passed, 1 unrelated `test_a5_npu_supports_dcp` failure (reproduces without fix) |\n| Non-dummy `ServerArgs.resolve_once()` | Invalid modes rejected; allowed modes resolve |\n\n**Same failure, reproduced end-to-end:** DeepSeek-V4-Flash, 4× B300, TP4/EP4, `--eplb-rebalance-num-iterations 1`:\n\n| Configuration | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| Base + `per_pass` | `AssertionError` during first rebalance, scheduler exits |\n| Fix + `per_pass` | Startup `ValueError` before model load |\n| Fix + `stat` | Rebalances successfully; `/generate` returns HTTP 200 |\n\nThe fix was ported from `297e54f` to upstream `main` (2 files, +33/-0). Unit tests and E2E were validated on `297e54f`, but have not been independently rerun on `main`. The regression test calls the real hook directly because the dummy-model path skips that resolution stage.\n\n**Accuracy / speed:** N/A — argument validation only; valid execution paths are unchanged.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41851001393](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41851001393)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41851001277](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41851001277)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41851001636](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41851001636)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
